@startuml
title login screen visual states

[*] --> EmptyForm
EmptyForm --> Submitting : user clicks Sign In
Submitting --> Success : valid credentials
Submitting --> InvalidCredentials : 401
Submitting --> AccountLocked : 403 locked
Submitting --> SelfExcluded : 403 excluded

InvalidCredentials --> EmptyForm : user edits input
AccountLocked --> EmptyForm : user retries or resets flow
SelfExcluded --> EmptyForm : user acknowledges message
Success --> [*]

state EmptyForm
state Submitting
state Success
state InvalidCredentials
state AccountLocked
state SelfExcluded

note right of InvalidCredentials
Visual test should confirm
generic credential error copy.
end note

note right of AccountLocked
Visual test should confirm
locked-account message and styling.
end note

note right of SelfExcluded
Visual test should confirm
self-exclusion warning state.
end note

@enduml
